      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Otay_Ranch_High_School",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The high school sits in Chula Vista, California, serving the growing Otay Ranch community.",
